    "recruitment": "Participants were recruited through the United States-Veteran Microbiome Project (US-VMP) at the Rocky Mountain Mental Illness Research, Education and Clinical Centers (MIRECC) in Aurora, Colorado, and active duty military and civilians at Air Force bases across the world."
